<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-22T16:30:00.040Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Intensified fighting in Sudan sees RSF drone strikes killing four near Khartoum and damaging a United Nations building, while separate drone attacks hit homes and UN premises in the capital. The Rapid Support Forces also continue ground offensives, with recent attacks on aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan causing civilian casualties. Humanitarian conditions are worsening as charity kitchens in Khartoum shut and displaced Sudanese, especially the elderly, face severe hardship. The conflict resulted in 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/israel-investigates-west-bank-fires&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/90cec5dc-f699-4966-886d-6277cc289ed0?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/22/west-bank-four-palestinian-villages-targeted-in-suspected-settler-attacks&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/netanyahu-rival-condemns-settler-arson-attacks-palestinian-villages-west-bank&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/22/jerusalem-daily-israeli-settlers-set-palestinian-vehicles-ablaze?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOR095ZVIzbVJLMUVaaUk5WGVaNllOVkdobGNyaWctdndlT0l4dWpxWDlJUEdFSEZQRm55QjJ5SnVDUFZfT2twTVBkbGhhRDFCSmIzM3RMVEQwTnRteDBiUVUtcTRDbFhFWENGeVpEVG9sMzROWDZSTEhfNjY0c216X0x5VDQyallYTE9vV2pDbWtLZ2V2TkpMZEtiNWRSalE1Y3A3T1FTekFiWUVJVngzbUZPckFsWFVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/22/arson-attacks-by-israeli-settlers-west-bank-add-tense-political-debate/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/22/israeli-settlers-attack-several-palestinian-villages-in-occupied-west-bank?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
